2026-10-13T18:15:56.1534531Z 
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1535121Z   adapter: Swoosh.Adapters.Local (local_mailbox)
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1535658Z 
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1536361Z Magic-link sign-in, password reset, email verification and access-grant
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1537343Z invitations will be ACCEPTED and never sent. The HTTP responses stay 200 by
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1538096Z design (anti-enumeration), so nothing else will tell you this.
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1538430Z 
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1539209Z Set SMTP_HOST (plus SMTP_PORT / SMTP_USERNAME / SMTP_PASSWORD as your relay
2026-10-13T18:15:56.1540142Z requires) to enable delivery — see deploy/smtp.env.example. Ignore this if
