inger, boss-approach stings, Dead-Eye arm). COMBAT (6 voices) for short throughput clips (fire, impact, ding, footstep, etc.). Total 8 voices.", "name" => "voiceLane", "options" => ["protected", "combat"], "title" => "Voice lane", "type" => "select"}, %{"description" => "The existing Godot signal Sfx lazily connects to (sfx never edits the emitter), e.g. 'combat.fired', 'combat.enemy_hit', 'swarm.enemy_killed', 'PlayerStats.level_up', 'player.damaged', 'crystal_collected'. Contract-only clips have no signal yet and are fired by a manual play_<name>() call.", "name" => "triggerSignal", "title" => "Trigger signal", "type" => "string"}], false, "document", [], "production", [], "megaphone", [], "private", [], [], %{"synthParams" => %{"decay" => "0.1", "freq" => "220.0", "wave" => "noise"}, "voiceLane" => "combat"}, [], %{}, %{}, false, %{}, ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:56.777210Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:56.777210Z], "3a9890bb-223e-4ba1-8ab5-abc44bac5023"]
