, eg shrink-wrapped trade pack, filled dumpbin, filled counterpack", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.254531Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.254531Z], "fdcd046d-3a47-41ef-aaaf-77a4ef59edb3", "0d4579cc-ebaf-4e37-848d-d5cd9934cf9c", "Multiple-item pack", "Carrying multiple components, primarily for retailing as separate items. The pack may be split and retailed as separate items OR retailed as a single item. Use instead of Multiple-item trade-only pack (code 30) if the data provider specifically wishes to make explicit that the pack may optionally be retailed as a whole", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.254531Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.254531Z], "3535f572-5290-488b-ad9b-fe47bd098f1b"]
