which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], "5596ff8d-deef-4ebc-bbe2-f6401f78d130", "baf42bd0-9f5d-4460-9751-3df3b17ba799", "Thickness", "For a book, the overall thickness of the spine. For a folded map, the thickness when folded. For packaged products, the depth of the retail packaging, and for trade-only products, the depth of the trade packaging. In general, the thickness or depth of a product in the form in which it is presented or packaged for retail sale", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], "4c6167f3-e31f-4705-9cfa-edd03edda0e0", "bd9f42a1-a7f7-4afd-aed2-2a4ea426b24b", "Page trim height", "Overall height (code 01) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], "9dc40da0-dcc1-4240-9a97-eeb57fdf381f", "c6263458-fe7c-404d-bcda-7f76b0b6c1e6", "Page trim width", "Overall width (code 02) is preferred for general use, as it includes the board overhang and spine thickness for hardbacks", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], "d7732e3f-cc64-4df5-9ed5-0cc50ceb37e6", "f9533142-5898-4e04-bc4c-255bcbda46a4", "Unit volume", "The volume of the product, including any retail packaging. Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], ~U[2026-10-13 18:15:57.485475Z], "3d10c8cc-d861-42b3-a076-bf3e795e2ee7", "5bb1263b-13d1-4c79-b2d7-892ce2a33765", "Unit capacity", "Volume of the internal (fluid) contents of a product (eg of paint in a can). Note the <MeasureUnit> is interpreted as a volumetric unit – for example code cm = cubic centimetres (ie millilitres), and code oz = (US) fluid ounces. Only for use in ONIX 3.0 or later", "eng", ~U[2026-10-13 18: